   Open Source Academic Research License Agreement. See the file
   tiegcmlicense.txt. That agreement permits use for research, academic,
   and non-profit purposes only. In particular, the software, any work
   containing it, and any data products generated with it may not be
   sold, licensed, or transferred for a fee, and the software may not be
   used for operational purposes (forecast, nowcast, or hindcast
   products).
